{
  "$comment": "Inferred semantic model — the handoff artifact produced by the nxd-semantic-data-product skill (inference mode) over the profiled CSV sample, driven by the stakeholder questions. Per model: description + per-column data_type (models.yaml vocabulary) and the ready __nxd_semantic__ role blobs. PLACE these blobs verbatim; do not redesign them. Columns with an empty roles list are promised attributes but carry NO semantic annotation.",
